  ],
  "headshot": "{{ site.url }}/assets/img/Headshot-Maryna-Kuzmenko-Petiole-hi-res.jpg",
  "website": "https://marynakuzmenko.com",
  "speaking": "https://marynakuzmenko.com/speaking/",
  "training": "{{ site.url }}{{ facts.links.training }}",
  "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/kuzmenkomaryna/"
}</textarea>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bio-section">
    <h2>Prompt to create a suitable bio</h2>

    <p>
      Copy, paste, and adapt this prompt when you need a specific version of my bio
      for a conference, podcast, grant profile, media feature, article, or speaker page.
    </p>

    <div class="copy-box">
      <div class="copy-box-header">
        <span>Reusable bio prompt</span>
        <button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy-target="bioPrompt">Copy Prompt</button>
      </div>

      <textarea id="bioPrompt" class="copy-textarea" rows="32" readonly>Write a professional bio for Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko.

Context:
- Speaker and trainer on AI in agriculture first; teaches AI in agriculture to more than {{ facts.reach.students | fullCount }} students across {{ facts.reach.countries }} countries
{% for book in books %}- Author of "{{ book.fullTitle }}"{% if book.series %} — book {{ book.series.number }} of the {{ book.series.name }} series{% endif %} ({{ book.amazon.kindle }}){% if not loop.last %}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
- Speaker at agrifood conferences, universities, and policy forums
- Trains agrifood teams (AI literacy and fluency): {{ site.url }}{{ facts.links.training }}
- Expert voice and influencer on AI in agriculture; LinkedIn Top Voice
- Does not offer paid consultancy or advisory services — do not describe her as a consultant or advisor
- Founder of MooMore (https://moomore.com/), which uses thermal imaging and on-device AI to detect inflammation in dairy cows before lameness becomes visible; {{ facts.moomore.status | lcfirst }}
- Winner of the {{ facts.award.wiw.name }}, announced {{ facts.award.wiw.announced }}, for MooMore — {{ facts.award.wiw.grant }} grant and a {{ facts.award.wiw.programme }}; {{ facts.award.wiw.selection }}
- Teaches AI in agriculture to more than {{ facts.reach.students | fullCount }} students across {{ facts.reach.countries }} countries
- Co-founder and CEO of Petiole, a UK-based SME
- Nearly 10 years of practical experience applying digital technologies in agriculture
- Main focus: computer vision and deep learning for plant phenotyping and food quality assurance
- Recognised as a LinkedIn Top Voice, May 2026
- Active educational presence in social and business media
- Petiole Pro was a finalist in the GIST Tech-I 2015 competition in the USA
- Petiole Pro was shortlisted for the UK FPC Fresh Awards 2023
- Petiole received {{ facts.petiole.grants }} for practical AI applications in agricultural challenges such as pest and disease detection (counted separately from Maryna's {{ facts.award.wiw.name }} for MooMore)
- Innovate UK award profile: https://iuk-business-connect.org.uk/projects/women-in-innovation/maryna-kuzmenko/
- Maryna is one of 16 Community Forum Members of the 2025/26 Cohort, pre-selected by the Innovate UK Women in Innovation team
- Maryna is an Oxford Farming Conference 2026 Inspire Fellow
